<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>On the free plan, payments in your store are created through our Stripe Connect platform as direct charges on your own connected Stripe account. We retain a platform fee of 2% of each transaction. Stripe's processing fees are charged separately by Stripe. Available gateways: Stripe and Apple Pay. You are the merchant of record and responsible toward your customers, including for taxes, refunds and chargebacks. Your use of Stripe is also subject to the <a href="https://stripe.com/legal/connect-account">Stripe Connected Account Agreement</a> and Stripe's other terms.</p>
