<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We may change the platform fee. We will tell you by email at least 30 days before the change takes effect. The new fee applies only to transactions after that date. If you do not agree, you can stop using the free plan or move to a paid plan before the change takes effect.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. Paid plans</h2>
