<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Prices are in euros per year. For consumers in the EU, the price shown includes VAT at the rate of their country. Business customers in the EU with a valid VAT identification number, checked with VIES, are charged no VAT under the reverse charge. Customers outside the EU are not charged EU VAT. Payment is due at purchase and at each renewal.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You pay through Stripe Checkout. Accepted payment methods include credit and debit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Link and other methods that Stripe offers in your country.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. Term, renewal and cancellation</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A paid plan runs for one year from purchase. It renews automatically for another year, and the renewal price is charged to your saved payment method, unless you cancel before the renewal date.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You can cancel at any time in your account under <a href="/my-account/">My account</a>. After you cancel, your plan stays active until the end of the year you have paid for and then does not renew. Cancelling does not lead to a partial refund. When a plan ends, the site returns to the free plan.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If we change the price of a paid plan, we will tell you by email at least 30 days before your next renewal. The new price applies from that renewal. You can cancel before then.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

